1
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:36,174
Kurozu-cho , town of my birth . Let me tell you the story ...

2
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:42,076
of a strangeness that happened here .

3
00:01:26,953 --> 00:01:34,953
U * ZU * MA * KI [ spiral ]

4
00:01:53,446 --> 00:01:55,687
Oh no ... I 'll lose again .

5
00:02:14,134 --> 00:02:17,013
Chapter 1 : Premonition

6
00:03:19,832 --> 00:03:21,072
Yamaguchi !

7
00:03:21,234 --> 00:03:22,269
Surprised ?

8
00:03:22,335 --> 00:03:23,279
Right ?

9
00:03:23,536 --> 00:03:24,412
Of course !

10
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:26,916
It 's just something I do .

11
00:03:27,006 --> 00:03:30,249
It is , huh ? How nice for you .

12
00:03:32,478 --> 00:03:34,617
Wh-What do you want ?

13
00:03:35,248 --> 00:03:38,422
Goshima ... be my girlfriend .

14
00:03:38,585 --> 00:03:39,689
What ? !

15
00:03:41,788 --> 00:03:42,892
Ok , ok ...

16
00:03:42,922 --> 00:03:47,598
You win , I 'm surprised . But I 'm in a hurry . Bye .

17
00:03:49,796 --> 00:03:53,573
Goshima ! I 'm serious ! I really like you !

18
00:04:18,258 --> 00:04:20,260
Is that Shuichi 's dad ?

19
00:04:39,145 --> 00:04:40,283
Hello .

20
00:05:36,436 --> 00:05:37,312
You 're here .

21
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,586
Guess I win today .

22
00:05:59,225 --> 00:06:00,363
Hey !

23
00:06:02,462 --> 00:06:05,272
Two on a bike 's illegal , you dumb kids .

24
00:06:10,603 --> 00:06:13,083
Wanted : Junji Ito

25
00:07:19,305 --> 00:07:23,082
Beauty Salon " Marble "

26
00:07:23,876 --> 00:07:24,854
Hello !

27
00:07:25,878 --> 00:07:27,084
Back from school ?

28
00:07:29,215 --> 00:07:30,751
It 's all tidied up inside .

29
00:07:30,817 --> 00:07:32,455
Thanks so much .

30
00:07:35,455 --> 00:07:36,160
Huh ?

31
00:07:37,957 --> 00:07:39,903
The sign 's gone .

32
00:07:41,093 --> 00:07:43,334
Oh , dear ... You 're right !

33
00:07:58,177 --> 00:08:00,783
I don 't get why we need tests .

34
00:08:01,914 --> 00:08:04,895
It 's okay for someone smart like you , Shuichi ...

35
00:08:05,818 --> 00:08:09,891
Me , I could keep up in middle school pretty easy ...

36
00:08:10,756 --> 00:08:12,758
Not now in high school , though .

37
00:08:13,359 --> 00:08:16,636
Especially math . I can 't get it .

38
00:08:17,263 --> 00:08:18,742
Makes me dizzy .

39
00:08:21,934 --> 00:08:22,708
So ...

40
00:08:22,768 --> 00:08:24,839
Yeah ? ... What .

41
00:08:28,107 --> 00:08:31,281
I saw your dad on the street a while ago .

42
00:08:32,645 --> 00:08:35,455
He was filming this snail shell ...

43
00:08:37,950 --> 00:08:41,989
But ... maybe ... it wasn 't him .

44
00:08:43,823 --> 00:08:44,733
It was dark .

45
00:08:45,825 --> 00:08:46,735
It was him .

46
00:08:48,694 --> 00:08:50,537
He 's weird lately .

47
00:08:50,897 --> 00:08:51,898
Is he ?

48
00:08:52,565 --> 00:08:53,908
Kinda , yeah .

49
00:09:06,846 --> 00:09:10,020
You don 't look well these days either ...

50
00:09:11,217 --> 00:09:12,787
Too much studying , maybe ?

51
00:09:14,554 --> 00:09:16,795
I think you can relax a bit ...

52
00:09:17,490 --> 00:09:22,269
You 'll get into a good university . Your grades are great , and -

53
00:09:22,595 --> 00:09:23,505
... Kirie .

54
00:09:25,264 --> 00:09:26,834
Will you elope with me ?

55
00:09:27,266 --> 00:09:29,507
What ? Elope ?

56
00:09:31,237 --> 00:09:32,773
No , you can 't , can you .

57
00:09:33,506 --> 00:09:38,922
Right out of the blue ? There 's a time for everything ...

58
00:09:39,245 --> 00:09:41,987
Sorry . Forget I said it .

59
00:09:46,852 --> 00:09:47,956
Let 's go .

60
00:09:48,721 --> 00:09:49,631
Shuichi ...

61
00:10:14,313 --> 00:10:15,917
480 yen , please .

62
00:10:20,319 --> 00:10:21,423
Here you go .

63
00:10:25,291 --> 00:10:27,293
200,000 yen change .

64
00:10:29,395 --> 00:10:32,274
That 's right , I hear your father took top prize .

65
00:10:33,366 --> 00:10:35,437
Yes , he did .

66
00:10:35,935 --> 00:10:37,608
That 's great .

67
00:10:37,970 --> 00:10:40,075
So now he 's " Goshima-sensei , " eh ?

68
00:10:40,206 --> 00:10:42,208
No , please don 't call him that .

69
00:10:42,642 --> 00:10:43,416
Oh , right .

70
00:10:43,442 --> 00:10:45,649
It 's still a special day , so ...

71
00:10:51,017 --> 00:10:52,189
Are you sure ?

72
00:10:52,685 --> 00:10:54,995
Of course ! To celebrate .

73
00:10:55,655 --> 00:10:56,861
Oh , wow ... Thanks !

74
00:11:14,206 --> 00:11:17,050
You get better and better , Mr. Goshima .

75
00:11:18,077 --> 00:11:21,388
You won the Midoriyama Exhibition prize , didn 't you ?

76
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:26,327
Oh , that ? ... that was just luck .

77
00:11:27,987 --> 00:11:28,897
No , no ...

78
00:11:29,989 --> 00:11:35,439
Pottery is the truest of the arts .

79
00:11:36,128 --> 00:11:38,699
The one with the true uzumaki .

80
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:44,913
The uzumaki as art ? I see .

81
00:11:52,244 --> 00:11:54,019
I do see ... !

82
00:11:55,481 --> 00:12:01,591
Uzumaki ! Sometimes it makes me dizzy , I must admit .

83
00:12:04,857 --> 00:12:06,859
Marvelous .

84
00:12:08,928 --> 00:12:13,604
Well , Mr. Goshima ? Will you create me a piece ?

85
00:12:14,366 --> 00:12:18,041
A platter that will really make my eyes spin .

86
00:12:18,370 --> 00:12:22,318
Make me one in an uzumaki pattern .

87
00:12:22,842 --> 00:12:24,947
So , a platter with an uzumaki pattern .

88
00:12:25,544 --> 00:12:26,454
Yes .

89
00:12:28,047 --> 00:12:28,957
A spiral .

90
00:12:30,216 --> 00:12:34,926
One that goes round and round and round .

91
00:12:35,421 --> 00:12:37,526
Round and round and round .

92
00:12:37,790 --> 00:12:38,768
Yes .

93
00:12:40,192 --> 00:12:41,102
All right .

94
00:12:43,062 --> 00:12:44,200
I 'll do it .

95
00:12:46,398 --> 00:12:48,344
Excellent .

96
00:12:51,036 --> 00:12:54,142
You know , Mr. Goshima ...

97
00:12:56,442 --> 00:12:59,446
when I see the uzumaki I feel ...

98
00:12:59,545 --> 00:13:00,489
a sense ...

99
00:13:00,813 --> 00:13:02,292
of deepest mystery .

100
00:13:02,481 --> 00:13:05,052
You feel deepest mystery .

101
00:13:06,252 --> 00:13:09,062
I knew you 'd understand , Mr. Goshima .

102
00:13:13,592 --> 00:13:15,594
The uzumaki is sublime .

103
00:13:16,929 --> 00:13:19,739
It is , in itself , the greatest work of art .

104
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:24,848
And you are the great artist ...

105
00:13:26,405 --> 00:13:27,543
bringing it forth !

106
00:14:02,141 --> 00:14:02,949
Yum .

107
00:14:08,848 --> 00:14:11,522
And here 's dessert .

108
00:14:16,388 --> 00:14:18,868
Fancy today , aren 't we .

109
00:14:19,124 --> 00:14:22,867
It 's from the greengrocer , to celebrate .

110
00:14:22,928 --> 00:14:25,204
Well , then !

111
00:14:29,668 --> 00:14:33,013
Another blessing from your o-mamori charm , Kirie .

112
00:14:38,544 --> 00:14:40,888
Take some credit , Dad .

113
00:14:43,749 --> 00:14:47,959
Shuichi 's father even said so . Gotta keep it up , now .

114
00:14:48,254 --> 00:14:49,927
Guess so .

115
00:14:51,023 --> 00:14:51,899
Here goes ...

116
00:14:53,859 --> 00:14:57,068
Hey-y-y , how 'd you know ? Were you listening ?

117
00:15:05,571 --> 00:15:07,573
Oh , that 's a good melon .

118
00:15:07,973 --> 00:15:09,714
Is it ?

119
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:16,920
You 're right ! That is good .

120
00:15:16,949 --> 00:15:17,859
Isn 't it ?

121
00:15:21,587 --> 00:15:22,497
Delicious .

122
00:16:05,864 --> 00:16:08,344
Kirie

123
00:17:29,048 --> 00:17:32,393
I was such a klutz , but you were always there .

124
00:17:37,356 --> 00:17:39,859
Even when my mother died ...

125
00:17:50,469 --> 00:17:52,642
Don 't cry , Kirie .

126
00:17:54,773 --> 00:17:56,116
Don 't cry .

127
00:17:59,211 --> 00:18:02,749
I 'll be your mother for you .

128
00:18:06,418 --> 00:18:09,763
I don 't want a boy for a mother !

129
00:18:23,102 --> 00:18:26,572
... Kirie . Will you elope with me ?

130
00:18:29,141 --> 00:18:31,246
Elope , huh ?

131
00:18:33,979 --> 00:18:35,253
Not quite yet ...

132
00:18:35,948 --> 00:18:37,256
dear Shuichi .

133
00:19:22,027 --> 00:19:23,165
Morning .

134
00:19:23,295 --> 00:19:24,205
Morning .

135
00:19:32,871 --> 00:19:36,785
Shuichi 's trying for a Tokyo university , isn 't he .

136
00:19:37,476 --> 00:19:39,422
And what 's it to you ... ?

137
00:19:42,514 --> 00:19:44,516
I guess so , yeah .

138
00:19:44,650 --> 00:19:48,530
You " guess " ? You mean you haven 't talked about it ?

139
00:19:50,622 --> 00:19:54,900
What kind 've answer 's that ? ! You 're going out , aren 't you ?

140
00:19:56,061 --> 00:19:58,905
We 're not " going out , " exactly .

141
00:19:59,898 --> 00:20:01,571
Now see ? That 's where you -

142
00:20:02,768 --> 00:20:03,906
Surprised ?

143
00:20:04,703 --> 00:20:06,205
Yamaguchi !

144
00:20:06,572 --> 00:20:08,882
You 're wasting your time .

145
00:20:09,341 --> 00:20:11,446
Kirie has a boyfriend .

146
00:20:11,977 --> 00:20:13,217
Shiho !

147
00:20:14,046 --> 00:20:17,550
I know . Saito Shuichi . Forget him , he 's a drag .

148
00:20:18,016 --> 00:20:22,226
If I can score a hottie like you , I 'll make everyone jealous .

149
00:20:23,388 --> 00:20:26,062
You 're the drag . Come on , Kirie .

150
00:20:26,258 --> 00:20:27,931
Hey , wait !

151
00:20:28,627 --> 00:20:29,970
Don 't follow us !

152
00:20:32,130 --> 00:20:33,370
Goshima !

153
00:20:38,937 --> 00:20:41,611
That 's some stalker you got .

154
00:20:43,242 --> 00:20:44,949
He ambushed me yesterday , too .

155
00:20:45,244 --> 00:20:46,120
He what ? !

156
00:20:46,712 --> 00:20:52,594
Better be careful . You 're not the first one he 's bothered .

157
00:20:53,252 --> 00:20:54,128
For real ?

158
00:20:55,520 --> 00:20:56,828
When you see him ...

159
00:20:57,556 --> 00:20:58,728
do this .

160
00:21:00,592 --> 00:21:01,502
What 's that .

161
00:21:03,962 --> 00:21:04,963
" Skirt " around him .

162
00:21:06,632 --> 00:21:07,508
Three points .

163
00:21:08,033 --> 00:21:08,943
Three-and-a-half .

164
00:21:09,534 --> 00:21:10,604
Three .

165
00:21:23,315 --> 00:21:24,316
Miyazaki !

166
00:21:26,618 --> 00:21:27,653
I liked him , too ...

167
00:21:40,832 --> 00:21:42,778
You all right , Kirie ?

168
00:21:43,935 --> 00:21:45,937
Yeah . Thanks .

169
00:21:46,838 --> 00:21:48,010
I 'm fine now .

170
00:21:48,940 --> 00:21:51,614
What a nasty thing to see .

171
00:21:52,344 --> 00:21:55,951
They said he was doing acrobatics on the handrail .

172
00:21:56,181 --> 00:21:57,319
What an idiot .

173
00:21:59,451 --> 00:22:04,799
But didn 't he look like he had a smile on his face ?

174
00:22:06,191 --> 00:22:07,363
Would you smile ?

175
00:22:20,005 --> 00:22:22,076
He died happy .

176
00:22:22,708 --> 00:22:23,686
Sekino ...

177
00:22:36,221 --> 00:22:42,399
It doesn 't matter how , so long as you 're noticed , yes ?

178
00:22:44,896 --> 00:22:48,810
If you 're not noticed , it 's like you 're not alive .

179
00:22:49,634 --> 00:22:52,410
I love it when people look at me .

180
00:22:53,105 --> 00:22:56,245
Wouldn 't you two agree ?

181
00:22:56,975 --> 00:22:58,977
I don 't really like sticking out ...

182
00:22:59,044 --> 00:23:00,819
The guy 's dead , okay ? !

183
00:23:03,648 --> 00:23:06,026
' Cause it 's the only way he 'd be noticed .

184
00:23:08,253 --> 00:23:12,861
I , too , want to be noticed ... especially now .

185
00:23:14,826 --> 00:23:18,273
I want to be seen ... in the truest possible way .

186
00:23:25,070 --> 00:23:28,176
It was a spiral staircase , wasn 't it .

187
00:23:28,340 --> 00:23:29,683
How 'd you know ?

188
00:23:30,208 --> 00:23:31,414
The uzumaki .

189
00:23:31,576 --> 00:23:33,578
The " uzuma " what ?

190
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:47,536
What 's the uzumaki .

191
00:23:56,067 --> 00:23:59,810
The spiral-pattern draws the eye .

192
00:24:00,205 --> 00:24:04,915
Whoever drew it , wanted to draw other eyes , too .

193
00:24:05,477 --> 00:24:09,448
The uzumaki drew the dead guy into it .

194
00:24:11,483 --> 00:24:12,791
No way .

195
00:24:15,454 --> 00:24:17,491
It was just an accident .

196
00:24:20,225 --> 00:24:23,536
I 've started having a bad feeling about this place ...

197
00:24:24,329 --> 00:24:27,776
I get dizzy just coming home through that tunnel .

198
00:24:28,467 --> 00:24:31,107
This town 's cursed by the uzumaki .

199
00:24:33,705 --> 00:24:37,482
I don 't feel anything ...

200
00:24:55,794 --> 00:24:59,503
My dad went to your place yesterday , didn 't he ?

201
00:24:59,898 --> 00:25:02,401
Huh ? Yeah ...

202
00:25:03,134 --> 00:25:05,774
He wanted a dish with an uzumaki pattern .

203
00:25:07,005 --> 00:25:10,350
He called my dad a great artist - -

204
00:25:10,408 --> 00:25:11,648
... You see ? Uzumaki .

205
00:25:13,512 --> 00:25:18,461
But that 's silly . Lots of people like uzumaki patt - -

206
00:25:18,850 --> 00:25:21,126
You don 't know what you 're talking about !

207
00:25:24,289 --> 00:25:25,165
I 'm sorry .

208
00:25:28,393 --> 00:25:30,304
My dad 's over the edge .

209
00:25:32,397 --> 00:25:36,311
He 's stopped going to work . He just walks around ...

210
00:25:36,501 --> 00:25:39,744
bringing home anything he finds with uzumaki .

211
00:25:41,006 --> 00:25:46,285
The house is full of stuff . If you call , he won 't answer .

212
00:25:46,878 --> 00:25:50,951
He just sits there , staring .

213
00:25:52,884 --> 00:25:53,794
Just last night ...

214
00:25:59,558 --> 00:26:01,037
Dad 's sick , you know .

215
00:26:03,028 --> 00:26:04,939
And you can 't take much more .

216
00:26:07,933 --> 00:26:09,105
He needs help .

217
00:26:34,993 --> 00:26:37,872
Beauty Salon " Marble "

218
00:27:25,777 --> 00:27:26,619
Here .

219
00:27:36,388 --> 00:27:37,765
It 's been a long day .

220
00:28:28,339 --> 00:28:29,181
Hey ...

221
00:28:29,974 --> 00:28:31,180
More spiral fishcake .

222
00:28:31,376 --> 00:28:33,720
That was the last of it .

223
00:28:34,345 --> 00:28:36,586
What ? No more ?

224
00:28:37,916 --> 00:28:39,054
I 'm sorry .

225
00:28:40,418 --> 00:28:41,726
Don 't apologize .

226
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:45,390
And I 'm supposed to eat miso soup without it ? !

227
00:29:20,024 --> 00:29:22,527
That calmed him down a bit .

228
00:29:23,962 --> 00:29:25,236
It 's not funny .

229
00:29:26,397 --> 00:29:27,375
But ...

230
00:29:35,206 --> 00:29:37,208
Come to my house .

231
00:29:38,176 --> 00:29:39,382
You 'll see .

232
00:29:44,649 --> 00:29:52,649
Dumb kids !

233
00:30:24,522 --> 00:30:27,969
You 've no idea what you 've done . I can 't allow it .

234
00:30:28,026 --> 00:30:29,164
Please , stop ...

235
00:30:30,028 --> 00:30:31,974
Dad ! What 's wrong with you ? !

236
00:30:32,096 --> 00:30:35,839
My collection ... she threw it out !

237
00:30:35,934 --> 00:30:37,174
I threw it out .

238
00:30:38,069 --> 00:30:39,980
You 're better off without it .

239
00:30:41,206 --> 00:30:42,082
What ? !

240
00:30:42,740 --> 00:30:44,083
What would you know ? !

241
00:30:44,108 --> 00:30:47,248
You weren 't always like this ...

242
00:30:47,912 --> 00:30:50,256
If only you could see - -

243
00:30:53,384 --> 00:30:54,488
Ah , well .

244
00:30:55,320 --> 00:30:57,425
If it 's gone , it 's gone .

245
00:30:57,989 --> 00:31:02,131
The collection 's not important . The idea 's enough .

246
00:31:02,727 --> 00:31:04,729
Finally , I 've realized that .

247
00:31:05,997 --> 00:31:08,637
One makes one 's own uzumaki .

248
00:31:09,267 --> 00:31:12,009
You listen , and listen good :

249
00:31:13,338 --> 00:31:16,683
One brings forth one 's own uzumaki .

250
00:31:17,876 --> 00:31:21,255
Like this , for example .

251
00:31:57,382 --> 00:31:59,953
Chapter 2 : Erosion

252
00:32:12,130 --> 00:32:14,736
What 's wrong ? You seem down .

253
00:32:17,268 --> 00:32:19,270
Haven 't seen Shuichi , huh ?

254
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:23,412
Did you fight ?

255
00:32:26,077 --> 00:32:26,987
Another girl ?

256
00:32:30,748 --> 00:32:31,988
You got dumped ?

257
00:32:34,285 --> 00:32:36,063
Then what 's wrong ? !

258
00:32:36,087 --> 00:32:36,758
Ishikawa !

259
00:32:36,821 --> 00:32:37,663
Yes , sir ...

260
00:32:38,957 --> 00:32:40,800
Do you want to fail again ?

261
00:32:56,240 --> 00:33:01,690
Katayama ! What time do you think it is ? !

262
00:33:03,481 --> 00:33:06,018
S-Sorry ...

263
00:33:07,986 --> 00:33:14,301
I-I don 't know what ... I left at the usual time , but -

264
00:33:14,726 --> 00:33:15,602
I know .

265
00:33:16,260 --> 00:33:22,302
It 's ' cause he 's so slow . A snail goes faster .

266
00:33:23,601 --> 00:33:24,739
Tsumura ...

267
00:33:25,336 --> 00:33:28,146
" Snail , snail ; you leave a trail ... "

268
00:33:28,206 --> 00:33:29,048
Oyama !

269
00:33:29,674 --> 00:33:31,654
Shut up with that stupid song !

270
00:33:38,349 --> 00:33:39,487
Katayama ...

271
00:33:40,151 --> 00:33:46,397
It 's true you only come to school these days when it rains .

272
00:33:48,092 --> 00:33:49,628
